@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+The Worker deployment owns the Cloudflare Durable Object bindings for exported `AIChatAgent` classes, a SQLite-backed Durable Object migration for each newly deployed class, the provider binding used by model calls, and coordinated deployment of the Worker code and configuration. Verify those bindings and migrations in the deployed environment; canonical static relationships do not prove them.
